<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">nerve-disruption</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Nerve Disruption</ansi> spell interferes with the target's neural pathways,
scrambling signals to muscle and limb. The afflicted target finds
their strength and dexterity substantially diminished for the
duration, making them far less dangerous in melee.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast nerve-disruption [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 5
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 40
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower and constitution resist the disruption
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Debuff — weakens target's strength and dexterity

